		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant moray eel, crocodile head. Psychic protectors of rivers and waterways.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 19, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (1d8) or fearful memories or seize magic or 1 spell +3, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fearful Memories</strong>. Wave of fear, all sentient creatures within near, WIS 15+ or flee for 1d4 rounds and forget about taniwha.</p><p></p><p><strong>Seize Magic</strong>. One spellcaster within near, CHA 15+ or lose the ability to cast a random spell, taniwha can cast spell. Spellcaster regains spell after resting.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
